    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="aff949e2-ad5b-543d-9b38-b28fef3eb37f" activityNameId="7d9ab6ac-0b6e-5013-b0af-0c52eb01e211" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">White spirit, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: White spirit, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of pure liquid white spirit. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
UUID: 7a06cff3-ccf6-3ea5-8bc1-a1929ff732e9
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air and water from production (incomplete), estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes omitted.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production out of naphtha by fractional distillation into appropriate boiling ranges and followed by different kind of treatments to obtain the desired type of white spirit. The overall process yield is assumed to be 75%. Inventory bases on theoretical reflexions. The emissions to air are rough estimates.
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: Process data based on stoechiometric calculations of few literature sources. Energy demand based on approximation from large chemical plant. Process emissions based on estimations only. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7a06cff3-ccf6-3ea5-8bc1-a1929ff732e9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
